      "uid": "zhcn:3fa3c78cecf9dfe26e305384",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是黑暗精灵。教你们一句咒语吧……\n“不给糖・就捣蛋”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d92991237b23957788a63f89c9cb97cbf50078419bd244fb72d18e149ace8199",
